    },
    {
      "id": "audio",
      "explanation": "game/audio_director.gd turns already-resolved rules events into sounds (moved -> SFX-HOP, damaged enemy by the player -> SFX-HIT, damaged player -> SFX-HURT, entering WON -> SFX-WIN once) and runs the music loop (duck on pause, fade on defeat, stop on win); default_bus_layout.tres provides the Music and SFX buses for M/N. The four ElevenLabs OGGs and the MusicGen loop are the assets. Heard in B14 (no narration), explained in B15, measured in B16.",
      "beat_ids": [
        "B15",
        "B16"
      ],
