      "explanation": "Headless suites: test_rules.gd (51 rules checks) and test_audio_events.gd (70 scene checks: sounds == events per id, echo/rapid input ignored, muted run identical) with route_runner.gd, test_report.gd and the two route fixtures, which also drive this film's capture; capture.gd (screenshots) and analyze_variants.gd (the exhaustive search behind CHANGE-BRIEF R1). B17 shows the recorded output; B12 cites the search. Tests use synthetic input and a fast clock, so they cannot judge feel or fun.",
